    "group": "Firestorm",
    "summary": "Whenever this model is the target of your **[Fire Overwatch](vsdata:ability/core.fire-overwatch)** Stratagem after an enemy **FLY** unit starts or ends a move (Advance, Fall Back or Normal), then as that Stratagem resolves, you can pick up to 3 more enemy **FLY** units up to 24\" from this model, besides that enemy unit:\n\n- this model can shoot its Firestorm scatter laser at each picked unit that is an eligible target\n- those attacks hit only on unmodified **Hit rolls** of 6",
